end
```

# FmrbApp.wallclock

wallclock() -> Hash?

The date and time now

The date and time now, or nil when the clock has never been set.
```ruby
t = FmrbApp.wallclock
Log.info("#{t[:hour]}") if t
```

# FmrbApp.wifi_connected?

wifi_connected?() -> bool

Whether WiFi is connected

