if FmrbApp.wifi_connected?
```

# FmrbApp.wifi_info

wifi_info() -> Hash?

How WiFi is doing

**nil on Retro.** Modern reports its WiFi, Linux the host's network.
```ruby
i = FmrbApp.wifi_info
Log.info(i[:ip]) if i
```

