# NsfHeader#artist

artist() -> String

Who made it

```ruby
h.artist
```

# NsfHeader#copyright

copyright() -> String

The rights notice

```ruby
h.copyright
```

# NsfHeader.parse

parse(String path) -> NsfHeader?

Read the title and the rest from a song file

Reads an NSF's header without playing it; nil when it cannot.
```ruby
h = NsfHeader.parse(path)
Log.info(h.song_name) if h
```

# NsfHeader#song_name

song_name() -> String

The song's title

```ruby
h.song_name
```

# NsfHeader#starting_song

starting_song() -> Integer

Which song plays first

```ruby
i = h.starting_song
```

# NsfHeader#total_songs

total_songs() -> Integer

How many songs are inside

```ruby
n = h.total_songs
```
